    <title>Release v3.0.9</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dscalzi/HeliosLauncher&quot;&gt;Helios Launcher&lt;/a&gt;를 기반으로 제작된 Mystic Red Space 서버 전용 런처입니다.&lt;br&gt;
런처를 사용하는 도중 아래 알려진 문제에 보고되지 않은 새로운 문제가 발생하면 &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/peunsu/MRSLauncher/issues&quot;&gt;이슈 페이지&lt;/a&gt;에 보고해주세요.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;설치 파일&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: &lt;code&gt;MRS-Launcher-setup-3.0.9.exe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MacOS: &lt;code&gt;MRS-Launcher-setup-3.0.9-x64.dmg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MacOS(arm): &lt;code&gt;MRS-Launcher-setup-3.0.9-arm64.dmg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux: &lt;code&gt;MRS-Launcher-setup-3.0.9.AppImage&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix MSFT authentication and vulnerability issues by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/peunsu/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/peunsu&quot;&gt;@peunsu&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3878763901&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/peunsu/MRSLauncher/issues/22&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/peunsu/MRSLauncher/pull/22/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/peunsu/MRSLauncher/pull/22&quot;&gt;#22&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/peunsu/MRSLauncher/compare/v3.0.8...v3.0.9&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v3.0.8...v3.0.9&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
